<title>NEW ZEALAND: RTRS-McConnell ends pipeline negotiations.</title>
<headline>RTRS-McConnell ends pipeline negotiations.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>McConnell Dowell said on Wednesday that negotiations had recently been concluded with a subsidiary of AGL for the construction of the 840 km Ballera to Mount Isa pipeline in Queensland, Australia.</p>
<p>The company was earlier awarded a contract for the design and major materials procurement.</p>
<p>McConnell said the total value of the works is some A$100 million. Construction is due to start within the first quarter of 1997 and be completed before the end of the 1997/98 financial year.  </p>
<p>The company said the main impact of the project will be felt in the next financial year.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64-4 473-4746</p>
